To create SSqllite3

Create & seed (idempotent):
python build_banking_db.py --db banking_mvp.db


Create tables only:
python build_banking_db.py --db banking_mvp.db --no-seed



Run Neo4J script:


python load_to_neo4j.py \
  --sqlite banking_mvp.db \
  --neo4j-uri neo4j://127.0.0.1:7687 \
  --neo4j-user neo4j \
  --neo4j-pass Neo4j@123



To run the API server:
uvicorn apps.graphrag_api.app:app --reload --port 8000